commit 933ec0ed7397570153577ada444924e216fca4ac
Author: cracki <cracki@gmail.com>
Date:   Wed Oct 7 15:53:36 2026 +0330

    fix(qa4-new3): language/industry/company-name detection in scan
    
    - Language: one Arabic character anywhere flipped the whole site to 'ar'
      (scraper.py _detect_language). Now <html lang> wins outright
      (normalized), else Arabic-script RATIO > 25% of letters; auto_scan
      precedence html_lang(high) > og:locale(high) > content heuristic(low).
    - Industry: plain substring scoring matched 'spa' inside 'space'
      (scraper.py _score_industries). Now whole-word \b matching; new
      home_services category (cleaning, ac cleaning, air conditioning,
      handyman, renovation, ...); 'high' confidence only when exact
      industry match AND top score >=2 AND lead >=2 — matching the FE which
      auto-selects only high-confidence candidates.
    - Company name: _clean_title took the first title segment ('Renovation
      company in Dubai | Renofit' -> the SEO prefix). Now the segment with
      the best domain-token overlap wins ('renofit.com' -> 'Renofit'), SEO
      preambles and 'Official Site' suffixes stripped, 1-4-word preference;
      og:site_name > schema.name > og:title > title_tag precedence kept.
    - brand/tests_qa4_detection.py: 15 tests.

